    <guid isPermaLink="false">66114d9b4f66d1c1da57a46c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Apr 2024 13:26:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期偶尔碰雌节目主要聊宋女士断亲的故事，一笔存款引发的家庭事故，并为本期碎碎念提供了丰富的素材。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：宋姐姐、翠花</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> &nbsp;断亲了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> &nbsp;面对长辈的恶意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> &nbsp;反抗的阶段性胜利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">27:26</a> &nbsp;父母的道德控制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> &nbsp;母女关系的微妙和嫉妒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> &nbsp;女性的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3013">50:13</a> &nbsp;宋女士的道德表演需要</span></p><span></span><p><span>宋姐姐本期评语：我怎么成了不断怼爹的依萍，不行，我要寻找我的刺。</span></p><span></span><p><span>翠花本期评语：我有很多刺，其中一些刺刺向重男轻女的人类。</span></p>]]></description>
